{"id":"480300a437f3008f","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system.md","title":"ZFC Pcf4 Ladder System","display":"df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system — ZFC Pcf4 Ladder System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system — ZFC Pcf4 Ladder System","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-comb9-stationary-set-on-cardinal]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system — ZFC Pcf4 Ladder System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1697a0344b965e07\" href=\"?note=1697a0344b965e07\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-comb9-stationary-set-on-cardinal\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-comb9-stationary-set-on-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (stationary-set candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec C\">\\(\\vec C\\)</span> (ladder-system function candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9StationarySetOnCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb9StationarySetOnCardinal}_S\\)</span> (stationary-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1697a0344b965e07\" href=\"?note=1697a0344b965e07\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-comb9-stationary-set-on-cardinal\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-comb9-stationary-set-on-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4LadderSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4LadderSystem}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}ladder\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4LadderSystem}_S(S,\\vec C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\kappa\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9StationarySetOnCardinal}_S(S,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec C,S,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec C))\n\\land\n\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\n\\land\n\\vec C(\\delta)\\subseteq\\delta\n\\land\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\vec C(\\delta))\n\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;(n\\in m\\to f(n)\\in f(m))\n\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\vec C(\\delta)\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(f(n)=\\gamma)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\delta\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\beta\\in f(n))\n\\Bigr)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}ladder\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4LadderSystem}_S(S,\\vec C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\kappa\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9StationarySetOnCardinal}_S(S,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec C,S,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec C))\n\\land\n\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\n\\land\n\\vec C(\\delta)\\subseteq\\delta\n\\land\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\vec C(\\delta))\n\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;(n\\in m\\to f(n)\\in f(m))\n\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\vec C(\\delta)\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(f(n)=\\gamma)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\delta\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\beta\\in f(n))\n\\Bigr)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient regular cardinal and stationarity of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> are now part of the predicate, while each ladder is an omega-type cofinal subset of its index.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-comb9-stationary-set-on-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"1697a0344b965e07","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-comb9-stationary-set-on-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-comb9-stationary-set-on-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"1697a0344b965e07","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcComb9StationarySetOnCardinal}_S$ (stationary-set predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-comb9-stationary-set-on-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S$ (regular-cardinal predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal]])